# Local review and fundraising artifacts are not part of the web deployment.
# Directory patterns are anchored with a leading slash: an unanchored `docs/` also matched
# apps/web/src/app/docs/ and removed the /docs route from the build.
/investor_data_room/
/pitch-deck/
/Screenshots/
Dave.png
Dave.png:Zone.Identifier
Funding.md
deploy-genlayer.mjs
resolve-genlayer.mjs
verify-genlayer.mjs
AGENT.md
*.Zone.Identifier
# contracts/genlayer/*.py is READ AT RUNTIME by deployTreasuryPolicy, so it must ship. Only the
# Solidity side is build-time-only. Excluding all of contracts/ silently broke every policy
# deployment with "Could not load TreasuryPolicy.py".
/contracts/evm/
/contracts/genlayer/__pycache__/
/docs/
*.pdf
*.mp4
*.pptx
*.csv
